{"parse": {"title": "TSW-07", "pageid": 100960, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-06\" title=\"TSW-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-08\" title=\"TSW-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AE.B1.E5.BA.AD.E8.B4.B8.E6.98.93.E8.8A.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"箱庭贸易节\">箱庭贸易节</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 箱庭贸易节</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Suitcase Trade Fair</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>随<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>返<span class=\"color-value\"></span>航<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192307</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰？这是……你要在贸易节上交换的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，我整理了一下，只有这些书，保存得还算妥当。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>《钟表的维修（进阶篇）》《诗歌韵律之美》《高效沟通：谈话技巧艺术》……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手小姐看着书的名字，眼神中带着微微诧异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这些书司辰都读过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我看完了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手小心地翻动了一下那些书籍，纸张分明，有阅读的痕迹，又被仔细保存，显得崭新。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，你手上拿的是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>噢……是一些拼贴手账本，我拼贴了封面……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎不太擅长介绍自己的创作，于是将手账本的封面打开又合上，再重新打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>可以在里面的空白处，贴上任何东西……没有限制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我记得你在学校的时候做过这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>啊、是的，司辰，这是我的一个……一个习惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想在贸易节上也会有人喜欢的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>嗯……希望如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，芭卡洛儿小姐告诉我，她和图图石子也一起准备了交换的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>多亏了司辰和芭卡洛儿小姐……我以前从没想过我们会在这里办贸易节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看到那些逐渐成形的摊位，每个地方都恰如其分地放置好一盏罗盘灼灼，在午后的阳光之中，它们尚未被点亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>今天竟然还来了这么多人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢！当心我的魔药箱，里面还有一些作为调配材料的惊愕跳跳虫，它们将保证我在跳跳贸易节脱颖而出……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>还有还有，我的提丰挂件，要悬挂在正中央，小提丰会为我带来许多客人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>苏芙比小姐，请务必看管好您的物品……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">新巴别塔：</div><div>魔药师小姐，你们该看看这些新培育的魔精，智慧，温驯，具备优秀的魔药试验素养。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">新巴别塔：</div><div>噢，亲爱的，千万别担心。今天的交易对我来说只是一次观光，我当然不会动真格的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一串活力十足的声音从旁边传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>欢迎光临，欢迎光临。资金紧缺，只好变卖我心爱的发明了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>日以继夜无纸打印机！魔精足迹转印分析器！像素转换镜片！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>支持现金交易，也支持优秀的发明交换……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人员熙攘，热闹非凡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一届“箱庭贸易节”正式开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵悠扬的乐声传来，为这个节日拉开序幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭卡洛儿演奏着她的乐器，有人停下来倾听，有人沉浸在琳琅满目的商品之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人犹豫不决，有人讨价还价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更多的人，被她身旁的摊位吸引了目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>努库泰澳的罗盘灼灼，贝壳项链，海螺吹哨，编织手杖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及将它们带来的努库泰澳人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这些来自海岛住民的手工品吸引了人们的目光，他们不约而同地走向努库泰澳人的摊位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>欢迎……欢迎看看努库泰澳的产品！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>这是我们手工编织的项链和手杖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-522320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-522320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-522320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅱ：</div><div>贝壳也曾保佑我们平安出海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的芭卡洛儿换了一首轻快的曲调，推动着人们高涨的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我们支持各种物品交换，请随意挑选！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，一些东西被拿走，更多东西被留下，放满了努库泰澳人的摊位。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当夜幕降临时，罗盘灼灼在摊位之间流转着，照亮每一处地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐手演奏的地方，拥有着更多被给予的光明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一支发出新芽，长出根系，斜插在细颈瓶之中的荧树枝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两把被郑重装饰的罗盘灼灼，特地雕刻出音符的图案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三盏魔药师小姐与图图石子交换的提丰小灯，随乐曲摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>自行判断商品价值的交易，双方离场后，将在日后的使用中重新评估其真正的价格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>符合机器能源供应需求产品：0件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>机体箱内能源供应使用占比：20%，排名：……2。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>理应在此补足因占用能源而欠缺的照明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>感谢您的慷慨……露西女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不客气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未到深夜，努库泰澳人的摊位的手工品已经售罄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>图图石子小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>司辰小姐！我们这里的东西已经都卖完了……这是你买到的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看到那几本书，被整齐地夹在她的身侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是我……没交换出去的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>原来是这样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>司辰小姐，我给你留了一条贝壳项链……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一条由各色小贝壳串的项链，奇特而精巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>它是更接近努库泰澳传统的贝壳项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>司辰小姐，我们都很感谢你和基金会……让我们留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>图图石子和我们能有新的住所，我们对此非常感激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-518720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>是啊，那些繁琐的申请手续，没有你的话，我们完全写不来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅱ：</div><div>还有图书馆登记表……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢谢你们……你们对这些书感兴趣吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>努库泰澳人艰难地辨别着那些书名，交流讨论着各自理解的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>钟表维修就是那个时钟，他们用来辨别时间的那个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子走到摊前，流露出交流的渴望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>司辰小姐，有一个问题，我想从你这里得到解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>在很久以前，哥哥和我说过，如果努库泰澳人离开了家，贝壳就会产生裂纹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摩挲着自己的贝壳项链，它们依旧完整如新，没有任何碎裂的征兆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我不太明白，哥哥说的是不是真的……我们还没有验证过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将自己的贝壳项链递过来，它们在夜色之中也光洁明亮，不显黯淡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遥远而神秘的力量依旧在其中延续，沿着纹路，静谧流转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……图图石子小姐，我能感受到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也许你哥哥说的是真的。只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你从未离开，所以它依旧完整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海岛的女孩听到这句话，静静地站了许久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到努库泰澳人呼唤她的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-520510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>图图石子！司辰小姐！我们选好了～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>我们要留下这本《高效沟通：谈话技巧艺术》！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们走到图图石子身边，脸上挂着图图石子熟悉的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像任何一次篝火旁的祈祷，海滩上畅快的合唱，出海时迎着海风，他们知道随时可以回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为它总是在脚下、身后，或是不远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>是吗？那真是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……太好了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-07"}}